Package: banrepstats
Title: Download Economic Data from Banco de la República of Colombia
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Fernando", "Salcedo Mejía", , "fernandosalcedom@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to browse the indicator catalog and download economic
    time series published by Banco de la República (Colombia's central
    bank) through the statistics API behind its SUAMECA portal. Provides
    functions to fetch and search the indicator catalog, download series
    as tidy data.table objects, and plot them with a consistent style.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/fersalme/banrepstats
BugReports: https://github.com/fersalme/banrepstats/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
